  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aedcd0dad30a75b0",
      "translationZh": "我刚刚发布了 El Pulpo 的 0.1.0 版本。这是一个用于本地 LLM 推理的代理/负载均衡器。我开发它，是为了解决在本地网络中托管推理服务时出现的一些需求：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5300820d592341f8",
      "translationZh": "我希望减少这样的麻烦：每当部署新模型或切换网络（比如旅行时使用 NetBird 或 TailScale），就得在各种智能体和运行框架中不断调整模型提供方的设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "90eadb536b82a437",
      "translationZh": "我真的很想知道我的设备是否值回了成本，所以需要监控 token 使用量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "54222c4554142674",
      "translationZh": "而且，自从我完全切换到 Qwen3.8 Flash Next 之后，我就需要一个负载均衡器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2763cb3f465e0673",
      "translationZh": "所以来试试吧。镜像大小只有 12.7 MB ;)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6234f2e1d1e2a1e3",
      "translationZh": "更多内容请阅读我的博客：https://claw-destine.com/blog/elpulpo-release/",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
